# The declared boot order, board 330. One step per line, in the order boot() runs them.
# A step is the callee path of a top-level statement of boot(), with #2 where a callee
# repeats and a shape tag where the statement is not a plain call. Regenerate with
#   node tools/split-guard/boot-order.mjs --write
# and do that only when the order really changed, because the diff on this file is the
# record that somebody meant it.

